    "directions": [
      "In a mortar pestle, add ginger, garlic, green chilli, salt to taste and make a smooth paste out of it.",
      "In a non-stick pan, add fennel seeds, cumin seeds, cinnamon stick, cloves, dry roast on medium flame.",
      "Transfer it into a bowl, add salt to taste once it cools down, grind it into a fine powder.",
      "In a deep bottom pan, add oil, ghee once it is hot, add star anise, curry leaves, cumin seeds and let it splutter well.",
      "Add prepared ginger garlic paste and saute it on medium flame until light brown in color.",
      "Add onion and saute it well. Add coriander powder, guntur red chilli powder and keep sauteing until the spices turn aromatic.",
      "Add tomato, green chilli and saute it well until tomatoes turn soft.",
      "Add little water and cook on medium flame for 5 minutes.",
      "Add prepared masala, curry leaves and mix it well.",
      "Add fried paneer and mix everything well. Simmer it for 5 minutes.",
      "Add coriander leaves and mix it well.",
      "Garnish it with fried curry leaves and serve hot with roti.",
      "In a bowl, add paneer, a pinch of asafoetida, turmeric powder, a pinch of degi red chilli powder, oil and marinate well.",
      "Heat oil in a non-stick pan, add marinated paneer and fry for a minute to make sure all the sides are cooked well."
    ],
